      "widgets_values": [
        "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the person in <Picture 1>. Reference role: identity, face, hair, and outfit anchor. Preserve facial features and clothing accurately.\n<Subject 2> is the person in <Picture 2>. Reference role: identity, face, hair, and outfit anchor. Preserve facial features and clothing accurately.\n<Subject 3> is the environment in <Picture 3>. Reference role: location, lighting, and atmosphere anchor.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] A five-second cinematic medium two-shot set inside <Picture 3>. <Subject 1> stands on the left and turns toward <Subject 2> on the right as they share a brief spoken exchange.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - face, hair, clothing, and build from <Picture 1>.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - face, hair, clothing, and build from <Picture 2>.\n<Subject 3> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - setting, color palette, and lighting from <Picture 3>.\nNo audio reference is used unless <Audio 1> is enabled.\n\ndetailed_description:\nNatural cinematic photography with realistic skin texture, soft warm key light, subtle film grain, and steady handheld camera movement.\n\n[Shot 1] Medium two-shot inside <Subject 3>: <Subject 1> stands on the left in three-quarter view and turns toward <Subject 2> on the right. The camera slowly pushes in with small amplitude and comes to rest framing both characters clearly.\n(S1) <Subject 1> smiles warmly and says: <d>[English] Are you ready to head out?</d>\n(S2) <Subject 2> nods and replies: <d>[English] Right behind you, let's go.</d>\n\noverall_soundscape:\nNatural indoor room tone, soft clothing rustle as <Subject 1> turns, and clear close-mic stereo dialogue.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nNone (clean dialogue and natural ambience)."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "value": "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the person in <Picture 1>. Reference role: identity, face, hair, and outfit anchor. Preserve facial features and clothing accurately.\n<Subject 2> is the person in <Picture 2>. Reference role: identity, face, hair, and outfit anchor. Preserve facial features and clothing accurately.\n<Subject 3> is the environment in <Picture 3>. Reference role: location, lighting, and atmosphere anchor.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] A five-second cinematic medium two-shot set inside <Picture 3>. <Subject 1> stands on the left and turns toward <Subject 2> on the right as they share a brief spoken exchange.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - face, hair, clothing, and build from <Picture 1>.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - face, hair, clothing, and build from <Picture 2>.\n<Subject 3> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - setting, color palette, and lighting from <Picture 3>.\nNo audio reference is used unless <Audio 1> is enabled.\n\ndetailed_description:\nNatural cinematic photography with realistic skin texture, soft warm key light, subtle film grain, and steady handheld camera movement.\n\n[Shot 1] Medium two-shot inside <Subject 3>: <Subject 1> stands on the left in three-quarter view and turns toward <Subject 2> on the right. The camera slowly pushes in with small amplitude and comes to rest framing both characters clearly.\n(S1) <Subject 1> smiles warmly and says: <d>[English] Are you ready to head out?</d>\n(S2) <Subject 2> nods and replies: <d>[English] Right behind you, let's go.</d>\n\noverall_soundscape:\nNatural indoor room tone, soft clothing rustle as <Subject 1> turns, and clear close-mic stereo dialogue.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nNone (clean dialogue and natural ambience)."
