    {
      "id": 31,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        0,
        660
      ],
      "size": [
        800,
        560
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 30,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Pika H3 Flex \u2014 Reference to Video (Ref2VA, 6-Step)\n\nPost-trained **MiniMax H3 Ref2VA** distilled by Pika to **6 steps** (`lcm` + `ManualSigmas`, CFG 1.0) with native stereo audio, multi-reference control (up to 9 images / 3 videos / 3 audio clips), and higher resolution support (up to `1344\u00d7768`!).\n\n## Models (reuses your existing MiniMax H3 Ref2VA base!)\n- **Only 1 new download needed:**\n  - `models/loras/pika_h3_flex_ref2va_v1_bf16.safetensors` ([HF Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/loras/pika_h3_flex_ref2va_v1_bf16.safetensors))\n- **Already shared with `MiniMax-H3_Ref2VA_MultiChar_4StepTurbo.json`:**\n  - `models/diffusion_models/minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors`\n  - `models/text_encoders/qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors`\n  - `models/vae/minimax_h3_video_vae_int8_convrot.safetensors`\n  - `models/vae/minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors`\n\n## Critical Rules\n- **Do NOT stack a Turbo/Lightning LoRA on top** \u2014 Pika H3 Flex is already distilled to 6 steps.\n- Keep **LoRA strength = `1.0`**, **sampler = `lcm`**, and **exact 7 `ManualSigmas` values** (`1.0, 0.972973, 0.923077, 0.8, 0.571429, 0.333333, 0.0`).\n- Requires **ComfyUI 0.44.0+** (100% native core nodes).\n\n## How to Use\n1. Load **2 or 3 reference images** into `<Picture 1>`, `<Picture 2>`, `<Picture 3>` (disconnect `<Picture 3>` if using only 2 images; add more `LoadImage` nodes to `ref_image_3..` for up to 9 images).\n2. **Want to pin an exact START (or END) image frame?** Select `Optional START keyframe` + `Optional START guide @ frame 0` (and/or END pair) and press **Ctrl+B** to un-bypass.\n3. **Resolution (RTX 3090 24 GB):** Default is **`0.5 MP` (`960\u00d7544`)** for fast, safe tests. Once the shot works, raise `ResolutionSelector` to **`0.98 MP` (`1344\u00d7768`)** for full HD-class Pika quality!\n4. Keep `ref_image_size = match` and `VAEDecodeTiled` active (lower `tile_size` `512 \u2192 256` if decode OOMs).\n5. **Last frame auto-saved** (`Pika_H3_Flex_Ref2VA_last_frame_*.png`) for chaining into the next clip.\n"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "# Pika H3 Flex \u2014 Reference to Video (Ref2VA, 6-Step)\n\nPost-trained **MiniMax H3 Ref2VA** distilled by Pika to **6 steps** (`lcm` + `ManualSigmas`, CFG 1.0) with native stereo audio, multi-reference control (up to 9 images / 3 videos / 3 audio clips), and higher resolution support (up to `1344\u00d7768`!).\n\n## Models (reuses your existing MiniMax H3 Ref2VA base!)\n- **Only 1 new download needed:**\n  - `models/loras/pika_h3_flex_ref2va_v1_bf16.safetensors` ([HF Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/loras/pika_h3_flex_ref2va_v1_bf16.safetensors))\n- **Already shared with `MiniMax-H3_Ref2VA_MultiChar_4StepTurbo.json`:**\n  - `models/diffusion_models/minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors`\n  - `models/text_encoders/qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors`\n  - `models/vae/minimax_h3_video_vae_int8_convrot.safetensors`\n  - `models/vae/minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors`\n\n## Critical Rules\n- **Do NOT stack a Turbo/Lightning LoRA on top** \u2014 Pika H3 Flex is already distilled to 6 steps.\n- Keep **LoRA strength = `1.0`**, **sampler = `lcm`**, and **exact 7 `ManualSigmas` values** (`1.0, 0.972973, 0.923077, 0.8, 0.571429, 0.333333, 0.0`).\n- Requires **ComfyUI 0.44.0+** (100% native core nodes).\n\n## How to Use\n1. Load **2 or 3 reference images** into `<Picture 1>`, `<Picture 2>`, `<Picture 3>` (disconnect `<Picture 3>` if using only 2 images; add more `LoadImage` nodes to `ref_image_3..` for up to 9 images).\n2. **Want to pin an exact START (or END) image frame?** Select `Optional START keyframe` + `Optional START guide @ frame 0` (and/or END pair) and press **Ctrl+B** to un-bypass.\n3. **Resolution (RTX 3090 24 GB):** Default is **`0.5 MP` (`960\u00d7544`)** for fast, safe tests. Once the shot works, raise `ResolutionSelector` to **`0.98 MP` (`1344\u00d7768`)** for full HD-class Pika quality!\n4. Keep `ref_image_size = match` and `VAEDecodeTiled` active (lower `tile_size` `512 \u2192 256` if decode OOMs).\n5. **Last frame auto-saved** (`Pika_H3_Flex_Ref2VA_last_frame_*.png`) for chaining into the next clip.\n"
      },
      "title": "HOW TO: Pika H3 Flex Ref2VA (6-Step, 3090 / Spark)",
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    }
